      "id": "migration-name-length",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:50 the primary key of templario_template_versions, named after the table: 27 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:66 table templario_document_instances: 28 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:77 the primary key of templario_document_instances, named after the table: 28 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 names in the migrations are longer than the server allows, so it stops the install or the update of the app with an exception. The table names are counted with the default prefix oc_.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:50 the primary key of templario_template_versions, named after the table: 27 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:66 table templario_document_instances: 28 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:77 the primary key of templario_document_instances, named after the table: 28 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "migration-bool-notnull",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:27 templario_templates.active, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:37 templario_templates.show_in_context, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 boolean columns are NotNull. Oracle cannot store false in such a column, so the server stops the migration with an exception. A boolean column needs notnull false.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them. From Nextcloud 33 on the server makes the column nullable on Oracle itself.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:27 templario_templates.active, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version000000Date20260914000000.php:37 templario_templates.show_in_context, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
